# Worktree bootstrap (Dose)

Before implementing, testing, or committing in a worktree:

```sh
npm install
cp "$PRIMARY/.env" "$WORKTREE/.env"   # never commit .env
```

Confirm Husky shim (worktrees often miss `.husky/_`):

```sh
git config --get core.hooksPath   # expect .husky/_
test -d .husky/_ && test -x .husky/_/pre-commit && echo "husky shim ok"
# if missing: npx husky
```

Stay on this worktree’s branch. New unrelated task → new worktree. Never `--no-verify`.
